ets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/3fa2a5ad6465fac9a07ff2041eebd330.poster.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/3fa2a5ad6465fac9a07ff2041eebd330.webm?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/3fa2a5ad6465fac9a07ff2041eebd330.mp4?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Reach the mountain\u2019s peak, the ultimate test of skill and determination. Every path, fall, and choice pushes you closer to the summit. A clear objective that demands focus, precision, and perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/2b2a8896dcff156929b6c31559ac794e.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/448c30e8839e6cd04dbfdf3a45f90f4a.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=72 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/fbe6baab271cce7c7aa01987262fae0f.poster.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/fbe6baab271cce7c7aa01987262fae0f.webm?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/fbe6baab271cce7c7aa01987262fae0f.mp4?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover forgotten stories and lost lives hidden within the mountain\u2019s depths. Exploration is richly rewarded with ancient relics, hidden paths, and secrets of the past. But the path is merciless, every step forward tests your resolve against the mountain\u2019s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/2b2a8896dcff156929b6c31559ac794e.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/1a141e9133a6a7c2068dcba3d356bf55.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/792d378e8986d7ca04f056915af53b72.poster.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/792d378e8986d7ca04f056915af53b72.webm?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/792d378e8986d7ca04f056915af53b72.mp4?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 12 diverse areas with stunning, immersive landscapes. From towering cliffs to a deep, dark cavern, every view tells a story. Beauty and danger coexist, daring you to look and leap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/2b2a8896dcff156929b6c31559ac794e.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/3ff52605d3c95b58dd1d7188d35f099f.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/81190eeeba1c90ae83f105f150917205.poster.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/81190eeeba1c90ae83f105f150917205.webm?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/81190eeeba1c90ae83f105f150917205.mp4?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb Solo, or together with friends in a seamless co-op experience. Share victories, face setbacks, and navigate treacherous paths as a team. Every player\u2019s journey is unique, but the mountain challenges all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/2b2a8896dcff156929b6c31559ac794e.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/1169bccbdcca5cb502c992daab14a19d.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Adventure</strong>: A journey filled with challenges, secrets, and immersive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking Scenery</strong>: Explore over 14 diverse areas with stunning vistas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Physics-Based Movement</strong>: Realistic, gamified controls focused on balance, momentum, and physics challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Jumping</strong>: Tight, precise controls are required for precarious jumps and unstable surfaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay</strong>: Master 4 distinct rides, each offering unique mechanics and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrow Paths</strong>: Navigate cliffs and narrow paths where a single mistake leads to a significant fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Multiplayer</strong>: Team up with other players (Up to 8) to face the mountain\u2019s dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather System</strong>: Weather impacts gameplay, from blizzards affecting visibility to winds altering player control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Progression</strong>: One mistake can send you falling back to the start, but with limited checkpoints available, every decision and movement carries weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard: </strong>A unique leaderboard experience never seen before :)<strong>.</strong><br><br>* To Understand ;).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/268de5510e2a2fc83d358b06e9e9eda5.avif?t=1746176708\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Support the development by WHISHLIST AND FOLLOW!</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/58a2b1f33f618e035d76edc2691aa031.poster.avif?t=1746176708\" width=348 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extras/58a2b1f33f618e035d76edc2691aa031.webm?t=1746176708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486420/extr